#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '40x46mm-M118 buckshot, black powder'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised 40x46mm buckshot load somewhat resembling M576, loaded into a "
"M118 canister.  Due to the limitations of weapons built to fire 40x46mm "
"grenades, it's much less powerful than most people would expect."
msgstr ""
"M118の薬莢を基に作った、M576用の弾薬に似た40x46mm簡易散弾です。対応銃器は本来40x46mm榴弾を発射するための銃なので、予想より遥かに低威力です。"

