#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Leather patches stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  "
"Covers your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr "縫合した革を結び合わせた即席の腰巻きです。品位を守ってはくれますが、それだけです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wool loincloth"
msgid_plural "wool loincloths"
msgstr[0] "腰巻き(羊毛)"

#. ~ Description for wool loincloth
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bits of wool stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers "
"your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr "縫合した羊毛を結び合わせた即席の腰巻きです。品位を守ってはくれますが、それだけです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "nanoskirt"
msgid_plural "nanoskirts"
msgstr[0] "ナノスカート"

#. ~ Description for nanoskirt
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Apparently the microskirt wasn't short enough."
msgstr "どうやらマイクロスカートでは長すぎたようです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pants"
msgid_plural "pants"
msgstr[0] "コットンパンツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pants'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of khaki pants.  Slightly warmer than jeans."
msgstr "ジーンズよりも少しだけ暖かいカーキ色のズボンです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "army pants"
msgid_plural "army pants"
msgstr[0] "軍用パンツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'army pants'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A tough pair of pants lined with pockets.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "複数のポケットが付いた軍採用の丈夫なズボンです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tough pair of pants Favored by the military.  This pair came in a grey, "
"green and tan camouflage.  The pattern is notable for it's lack of black."
msgstr "軍人に人気の丈夫なズボンです。灰色、緑色、黄褐色からなる迷彩柄ですが、黒色を使っていない点が特徴です。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants patterned in desert camouflage.  They are "
"lined with deep pockets."
msgstr "砂漠用迷彩をモチーフにした丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。深いポケットが付いています。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants with a black, green and tan pixel camouflage "
"pattern.  Commonly seen worn by US Marines."
msgstr "黒色、緑色、黄褐色からなるデジタル迷彩柄の、丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。一般的には米国海兵隊が着用しているとされるものです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants with a black, brown, green and tan camouflage"
" pattern.  They look old."
msgstr "黒色、茶色、緑色、黄褐色からなる迷彩柄の、丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。履き古されているようです。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tough pair of military pants with a predominantly dark blue camouflage.  "
"Favored by the navy."
msgstr "濃青色を主体とした迷彩柄の、丈夫なミリタリーパンツです。この柄は海軍に人気です。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
