#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried eggs'}
#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sunny-side up eggs fried with a runny yolk and just a bit of crisp on the "
"edges."
msgstr "黄身が固まらず白身の端が少しカリカリになる程度に片面を焼き上げた目玉焼きです。"

#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
