#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "brown and magenta four-legged juvenile"
msgid_plural "brown and magenta four-legged juveniles"
msgstr[0] "四足歩行恐竜幼体(茶色&赤紫色)"

#. ~ Description for brown and magenta four-legged juvenile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge four-legged plant-eating juvenile sauropod with a long neck and tail,"
" it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "長い首と尾をもつ巨大な草食性竜脚類の幼体です。複数の異なる種が交配している可能性があります。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "green and magenta four-legged juvenile"
msgid_plural "green and magenta four-legged juveniles"
msgstr[0] "四足歩行恐竜幼体(緑色&赤紫色)"

