msgid ""
"A small four-legged plant-eating dinosaur juvenile with huge shiny eyes, it "
"could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "光沢のある大きな瞳が特徴的な、小さな四足歩行草食恐竜の幼体です。複数の異なる種が交配している可能性があります。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "green and yellow four-legged juvenile"
