msgstr[0] "四足歩行恐竜幼体(灰色&赤紫色)"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "winged juvenile"
msgid_plural "winged juveniles"
msgstr[0] "翼竜幼体"

#. ~ Description for winged juvenile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small winged dinosaur juvenile with huge shiny eyes, it could be from a "
"number of different species."
msgstr "光沢のある大きな瞳が特徴的な、翼が生えた小さな恐竜の幼体です。複数の異なる種が交配している可能性があります。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mosasaurus juvenile"
msgid_plural "mosasaurus juveniles"
msgstr[0] "モササウルス幼体"

#. ~ Description for mosasaurus juvenile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A juvenile mosasaurus with huge shiny eyes."
msgstr "光沢のある大きな瞳が特徴的なモササウルスの幼体です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Qianzhousaurus juvenile"
msgid_plural "Qianzhousaurus juveniles"
msgstr[0] "若いキアンゾウサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Qianzhousaurus juvenile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A juvenile Pinnochio Rex, It looks at you with fear and hatred at the same "
"time."
msgstr "恐怖と憎しみをその目に宿す、幼いピノキオ・レックスです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Kosmoceratops juvenile"
msgid_plural "Kosmoceratops juveniles"
msgstr[0] "コスモケラトプス幼生"

#. ~ Description for Kosmoceratops juvenile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A juvenile Kosmoceratops, seems relatively harmless as long as you don't "
"anger it."
msgstr "幼いコスモケラトプスは、怒らせない限り比較的無害です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Amargasaurus juvenile"
msgid_plural "Amargasaurus juveniles"
msgstr[0] "アマルガサウルス幼生"

#. ~ Description for Amargasaurus juvenile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A juvenile Amargasaurus, seems unbothered by your presence."
msgstr "幼いアマルガサウルスは、こちらに興味がないようです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビディロフォサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Dilophosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized dinosaur with sharp teeth and two "
"prominent bony crests on its head, with ragged strips of ripped flesh "
"hanging down like a frill."
msgstr ""
"脚を引きずって歩く中型恐竜のゾンビです。鋭い牙が生えており、頭部には特徴的な2つの頭骨があります。傷ついた身体から肉片がフリルのように垂れ下がっています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Zombie dragon"
msgid_plural "Zombie dragons"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビドラゴン"

#. ~ Description for Zombie dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie is enormous, scaly, studded with bony spikes, and it moves with "
"horrible speed.  Its colorful horns are worn and wet with filth and its "
"bright scales and bone spikes have taken a beating."
msgstr "全身を鱗と骨の棘で覆った、恐ろしいスピードで動く巨大なゾンビドラゴンです。色鮮やかな角は摩耗して不潔に汚れており、鱗と棘も損傷しています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spinosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Spinosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビスピノサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Spinosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Enormous putrid dinosaur corpse with a ferocious crocodile-like head, oozing"
" black eyes, and a tattered sail on its back."
msgstr "瞳から黒い液体が滲み出ている、ボロボロの帆を背負ったワニのような獰猛な顔つきのゾンビ恐竜です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Allosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Allosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Allosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shambling corpse of a large predatory bipedal dinosaur, with tiger-like "
"stripes on its broad, scaled back."
msgstr "大型の捕食性二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。鱗が生えた広い背中に虎のような縞模様があります。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Acrocanthosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Acrocanthosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアクロカントサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Acrocanthosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shambling corpse of a huge, bipedal dinosaur predator, with a tall ridge"
" running down the length of its back covered with heavy muscles.  Its teeth "
"are curved and serrated like sawblades."
msgstr "背骨に沿って生えた突起が特徴的な、筋肉質の二足歩行肉食恐竜ゾンビです。ノコギリの刃のように湾曲した牙が口内に並んでいます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Siats zombie"
msgid_plural "Siats zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビシアッツ"

#. ~ Description for Siats zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shambling corpse of a huge, bipedal dinosaur predator with long claws "
"and strong arms for grappling."
msgstr "長い爪と組みつきに適した強力な腕をもつ二足歩行肉食恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Albertosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Albertosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアルバートサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Albertosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive jaws drooling black liquid, lifted over grasping claws by a huge "
"shuffling dinosaur corpse."
msgstr "鋭い爪を生やした脚を引きずって歩く巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。立派な顎から黒い液体が垂れています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Qianz zombie"
msgid_plural "Qianz zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビキアンゾウサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Qianz zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An undead Qianzhousaurus, looking at you with a furious rage in its eyes and"
" seeming intent on eating you."
msgstr "猛烈な怒りをその目に宿しながら熱心に獲物を探す、キアンゾウサウルスのゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Z-Rex"
msgid_plural "Z-Rexes"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビティラノサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Z-Rex
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Massive piles of ragged, stinking flesh lifting enormous teeth."
msgstr "巨大な牙が生えた、悪臭を放つ傷だらけの筋肉の塊です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chained Tyrannosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "chained Tyrannosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "封印ゾンビティラノサウルス"

#. ~ Description for chained Tyrannosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive dinosaur corpse with enormous teeth wrapped with heavy chains to "
"allow some control."
msgstr "巨大な顎に頑丈な鎖が巻きつけられた、ある程度制御可能な巨大恐竜のゾンビです。"

#. ~ Description for Albertosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive jaws drooling black liquid lifted over grasping claws by a huge "
"shuffling dinosaur corpse."
msgstr "鋭い爪を生やした脚を引きずって歩く巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。立派な顎から黒い液体が垂れています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Gallimimus zombie"
msgid_plural "Gallimimus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビガリミムス"

#. ~ Description for Gallimimus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur, covered with "
"tattered feathers and black, putrid liquid."
msgstr "ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Nothronychus zombie"
msgid_plural "Nothronychus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビノトロニクス"

#. ~ Description for Nothronychus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a large-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with tattered"
" feathers and black putrid liquid.  Sharp curved claws protrude from its "
"hands."
msgstr "ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く大型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。手には鋭く湾曲した爪が生えています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Deinonychus zombie"
msgid_plural "Deinonychus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビデイノニクス"

#. ~ Description for Deinonychus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with "
"tattered feathers and black putrid liquid.  Both feet brandish a large "
"sickle-like claw."
msgstr "ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。両足から生えた鎌のような爪を振り回しています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Utahraptor zombie"
msgid_plural "Utahraptor zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビユタラプトル"

#. ~ Description for Utahraptor zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The swaying, hopping corpse of a large bipedal dinosaur with feathered arms,"
" a long tail, and long, sharp scythe-like claws."
msgstr "羽毛に覆われた腕、長い尾、大鎌のような鉤爪を持つ大型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。フラフラと動きまわり、時折飛び跳ねています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Undead Amargasaurus"
msgid_plural "Undead Amargasaurus"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアマルガサウルス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Undead Amargasaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A zombie amargasaurus, it has begun using its spikes for hunting."
msgstr "ゾンビ化したアマルガサウルスです。背中の棘を狩りに活用するようになりました。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Apatosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Apatosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアパトサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Apatosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a long, whip-like "
"tail.  The head is still upright and the neck looks like it would still make"
" a good, strong club."
msgstr "長い首と鞭のように伸びた尻尾をもつ、巨大な四足歩行の恐竜のゾンビです。頭は高い位置にあり、首は頑丈な打撃武器になりそうです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Brontosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Brontosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビブロントサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Brontosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a bulky torso and a "
"long, whip-like tail."
msgstr "太い胴と長い鞭のような尾をもつ、首の長い巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Diplodocus zombie"
msgid_plural "Diplodocus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビディプロドクス"

#. ~ Description for Diplodocus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a long, whip-like tail and a "
"tiny head with vacant white eyes.  Sways and staggers."
msgstr "首が長く巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。長い鞭のような尾をもっており、目玉は抜け落ちたようです。動く度によろめきます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Camarasaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Camarasaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビカマラサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Camarasaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a long, whip-like "
"tail.  The head is still upright and the neck looks like it would still make"
" a good, strong club."
msgstr "長い首と鞭のように伸びた尻尾をもつ、巨大な四足歩行の恐竜のゾンビです。頭は高い位置にあり、首は頑丈な打撃武器になりそうです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Brachiosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Brachiosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビブラキオサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Brachiosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gigantic, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with longer forelegs and "
"a whip-like tail."
msgstr "発達した前足と長い鞭のような尾をもつ、首の長い巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Alamosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Alamosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアラモサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Alamosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gigantic, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse, protected by natural "
"bone armor and a spiked tail."
msgstr "骨の鎧と棘の生えた尾をもつ、首の長い巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Stegosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Stegosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビステゴサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Stegosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, shambling quadruped dinosaur corpse, dragging with the weight of "
"the plates on its back - waving a much livelier-looking spiked tail."
msgstr ""
"背中に大きな骨質の板がいくつも生えた、動きの鈍い大型の四足歩行恐竜です。脚を引きずっていますが、棘の生えた尻尾を生前よりも激しく振り回しています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dyoplosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Dyoplosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビディオプロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Dyoplosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This armored dinosaur corpse looks like a giant prehistoric armadillo.  Its "
"tail ends in a spiked club of bone."
msgstr "巨大な古代アルマジロといった風体の、ゾンビ化した恐竜です。尾の先端が棘付き棍棒になっています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Ankylosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Ankylosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビアンキロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Ankylosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of what looks like a giant armadillo with peeling "
"armored plates and black, glistening eyes.  Its tail ends in a massive "
"spiked club of bone."
msgstr "剥がれかけた装甲と黒く光る目をもつ、巨大なアルマジロといった風体の恐竜のゾンビです。尾の先端が棘付き棍棒になっています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Nodosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Nodosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビノドサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Nodosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This heavily-armored dinosaur corpse looks like a giant prehistoric "
"armadillo."
msgstr "巨大な古代アルマジロといった風体の、分厚い装甲をもつゾンビ化した恐竜です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Edmontonia zombie"
msgid_plural "Edmontonia zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビエドモントニア"

#. ~ Description for Edmontonia zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This heavily-armored dinosaur corpse looks like a giant prehistoric "
"armadillo with long, bony spikes."
msgstr "巨大な古代アルマジロといった風体の、長い骨の棘が生えた分厚い装甲をもつゾンビ化した恐竜です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Campto zombie"
msgid_plural "Campto zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビカンプトサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Campto zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a large, feathered, bipedal dinosaur with strong "
"legs, broad shoulders, and a pointed beak.  Its tattered feathers are "
"stained with black, sticky liquid."
msgstr "頑丈な足と幅広い肩、尖ったくちばしが特徴的な、羽毛が生えた大型の二足歩行恐竜ゾンビです。ボロボロの羽毛は黒い粘液で汚れています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Maiasaura zombie"
msgid_plural "Maiasaura zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビマイアサウラ"

#. ~ Description for Maiasaura zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with hooves and a heavy tail, dead but walking, "
"eyes vacant and swollen.  Has a flat beak, thick nose, and a small but spiky"
" head crest."
msgstr ""
"蹄と太い尾をもつ、まだら模様の鱗が生えた巨大な恐竜です。死後も動き続けており、目玉を失った目蓋が腫れています。平らなくちばしと大きな鼻、尖った頭頂部が特徴です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Parasaurolophus zombie"
msgid_plural "Parasaurolophus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビパラサウロロフス"

#. ~ Description for Parasaurolophus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with a blunt head crest, dead but walking, eyes "
"vacant and swollen."
msgstr "棒状のとさかをもつ、まだら模様の大型恐竜です。死後も動き続けており、目玉を失った目蓋が腫れています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Corythosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Corythosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビコリトサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Corythosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a short beak and a tall head crest, dead but "
"walking, eyes vacant and swollen."
msgstr "短いくちばしと発達した頭頂部をもつ、鱗が生えた巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。死後も動き続けており、目玉を失った目蓋が腫れています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Edmontosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Edmontosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビエドモントサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Edmontosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a broad, toothless beak, dead but walking, eyes "
"vacant and swollen."
msgstr "歯がなく平たいくちばしをもつ、鱗が生えた巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。死後も動き続けており、目玉を失った目蓋が腫れています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pachycephalosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Pachycephalosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビパキケファロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Pachycephalosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with "
"tattered feathers and black, putrid liquid.  It resembles a reptilian "
"ostrich with a hard-looking domed head."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。町長部は硬そうな丸いドーム型になっており、ダチョウのような外見です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chained Pachycephalosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "chained Pachycephalosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "封印ゾンビパキケファロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for chained Pachycephalosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A feathered dinosaur corpse with a domed head with heavy chains to allow "
"some control."
msgstr "ドーム型の頭頂部に頑丈な鎖が巻きつけらている、ある程度制御可能な、羽毛が生えた恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pachyrhinosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Pachyrhinosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビパキリノサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Pachyrhinosaurus zombie
#. ~ Description for Pentaceraterror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a tall, bony crest "
"from which four long horns and a short nose horn emerge.  Its eyes ooze "
"black, putrid tears."
msgstr ""
"大きな骨張ったトサカから4本の長い角が生えている、鼻骨が平たいサイのような姿の巨大な恐竜です。フラフラと動き回り、目元には黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pentaceraterror"
msgid_plural "Pentaceraterrors"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビペンタケラトプス"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Undead Kosmoceratops"
msgid_plural "Undead Kosmoceratops"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビコスモケラトプス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Undead Kosmoceratops'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An undead Kosmoceratops, it seems to have forgotten its herbivorous diet and"
" looks hungry for your flesh."
msgstr "ゾンビ化したコスモケラトプスです。自分が草食動物だったことを忘れ、肉を渇望しているようです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Torosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Torosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビトロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Torosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a tall, bony crest "
"from which two wicked-looking horns emerge.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid "
"tears."
msgstr "サイに似た巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。盾のような硬質のとさかと2本の大きな角が特徴です。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Triceraterror"
msgid_plural "Triceraterrors"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビトリケラトプス"

#. ~ Description for Triceraterror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a bony crest from "
"which three wicked-looking horns emerge.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "サイに似た巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。盾のような硬質のとさかと3本の大きな角が特徴です。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pteranodon zombie"
msgid_plural "Pteranodon zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビプテラノドン"

#. ~ Description for Pteranodon zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The ragged but flying corpse of a large, feathered reptile with a long, "
"pointy, toothless beak and a long, pointy head crest."
msgstr "翼がボロボロになった、大型翼竜のゾンビです。歯が生えておらず先端が尖ったくちばしと、角のような頭部の突起が特徴的です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Quetzalcoatlus zombie"
msgid_plural "Quetzalcoatlus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビケツァルコアトルス"

#. ~ Description for Quetzalcoatlus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The ragged but flying corpse of a large, feathered reptile with a long, "
"pointy, toothless beak and a long, rigid neck."
msgstr "翼がボロボロになった、大型翼竜のゾンビです。刃が生えておらず先端が尖ったくちばしと、長く頑丈な首が特徴的です。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Mosasaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "Mosasaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビモササウルス"

#. ~ Description for Mosasaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The ragged bloated corpse of a huge aquatic dinosaur the size of a house, "
"with a crocodile-like head and swimming fins."
msgstr "ワニのような頭部と水を掻くヒレを備えた、小さな家ほどのサイズの巨大な水生恐竜ゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "juvenile sauropod zombie"
msgid_plural "juvenile sauropod zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビ幼体竜脚類"

#. ~ Description for juvenile sauropod zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, four-legged, herbivorous dinosaur juvenile's corpse that could be "
"from a number of different species."
msgstr "小さな四足歩行草食恐竜の幼体のゾンビです。複数の異なる種が交配している可能性があります。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "juvenile Alamosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "juvenile Alamosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビ幼体アラモサウルス"

#. ~ Description for juvenile Alamosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The corpse of a small, four-legged, herbivorous dinosaur juvenile, with "
"natural bone armor plates."
msgstr "天然の骨の鎧を備えた、小さな四足歩行草食恐竜の幼体のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Gallimimus zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Gallimimus zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造ガリミムス兵ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description for Gallimimus zombie bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics, "
"tattered feathers, and black putrid liquid with glowing curved claws."
msgstr ""
"フラフラと動き回る二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。生体部品はパチパチと音を立て、羽毛はボロボロになり、光り輝く鉤爪には黒い粘液がこびりついています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pachy zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Pachy zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造パキケファロサウルス兵ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description for Pachy zombie bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a bipedal dinosaur with a round hard-looking domed "
"head.  The body is dotted with crackling bionics, tattered feathers, and "
"black putrid liquid and carries glowing, curved claws."
msgstr ""
"硬そうなドーム状の頭部が特徴的な、フラフラと動き回る二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。生体部品はパチパチと音を立て、羽毛はボロボロになり、光り輝く鉤爪には黒い粘液がこびりついています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Triceraterror bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Triceraterror bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造トリケラトプス兵ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description for Triceraterror bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive shambling rhino-like dinosaur corpse dotted with crackling bionics"
" with a bony crest and three wicked looking glowing horns.  Its black eyes "
"ooze like tears."
msgstr ""
"サイに似た姿の、フラフラと動き回る巨大な恐竜のゾンビです。生体部品がパチパチと音を立てており、盾のような硬質のとさかと、邪悪な光を放つ3本の大きな角が特徴です。目元に黒い液体が涙のように滲んでいます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Deino zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Deino zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造デイノニクス兵ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description for Deino zombie bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bipedal dinosaur covered with tattered feathers, black goo, and crackling "
"bionics.  Each foot has a large glowing sickle-like claw."
msgstr ""
"生体部品がパチパチと音を立てている、ボロボロの羽毛を持つ中型の二足歩行恐竜です。全身が黒い粘液に覆われており、両足の先端に大きく光る鎌のような鉤爪が生えています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spinosaurus zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Spinosaurus zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造スピノサウルス兵ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description for Spinosaurus zombie bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shiny finned dinosaur corpse covered with bloody armor and crackling "
"bionics.  It shambles quickly as it hunts.  Is that a laser rifle on its "
"head?"
msgstr "血まみれの装甲と乾いた音を発する生体部品に覆われた、ヒレをもつ艶やかな恐竜のゾンビです。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"TARGET *zZzZzz* ACQUIRED.\""
msgstr "「目標...*ザザザザ*...捕捉」"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "*zZzzz*-TARGET ACQUIRED.  *beeeeeeeeep*.  OUT OF AMMO.-*zZzZ*"
msgstr "「*ザザザザ*...目標を捕捉...*ビイィィィィィッ*...弾薬残量なし...*ザザザ*」"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Crested Crusher"
msgid_plural "Crested Crushers"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビディロフォサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Crested Crusher
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized dinosaur with sharp teeth and two "
"prominent bony crests on its head, with ragged strips of ripped flesh "
"hanging down like a frill.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles "
"and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"脚を引きずって歩く中型恐竜のゾンビです。鋭い牙が生えており、頭部には特徴的な2つの頭骨があります。傷ついた身体から肉片がフリルのように垂れ下がっています。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Draco Titan"
msgid_plural "Draco Titans"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビケラトサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Draco Titan
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie is enormous, scaly, studded with bony spikes, and moving with "
"horrible speed.  Its colorful horns and bone spikes sit on a body bulging "
"with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"全身を鱗と骨の棘で覆った、恐ろしいスピードで動く巨大なゾンビドラゴンです。色鮮やかな角が生えており、全身が傷で化膿し、筋肉は異様に膨れ上がっています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spino Sledge"
msgid_plural "Spino Sledges"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビスピノサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Spino Sledge
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Enormous putrid dinosaur corpse with a ferocious crocodile-like head, oozing"
" black eyes, and a tattered sail on its back.  Its body is even bigger than "
"normal, bulging with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"瞳から黒い液体が滲み出ている、ボロボロの帆を背負ったワニのような獰猛な顔つきのゾンビ恐竜です。通常よりも大きく成長しており、膨張した筋肉のあちこちに付いた傷は化膿しています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Allosaurus Avalanche"
msgid_plural "Allosaurus Avalanches"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビアロサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Allosaurus Avalanche
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shambling corpse of a large predatory bipedal dinosaur.  Its entire body"
" bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "大型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Acrocanthosaurus Avenger"
msgid_plural "Acrocanthosaurus Avengers"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビアクロカントサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Acrocanthosaurus Avenger
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shambling corpse of a large predatory bipedal dinosaur with curved, "
"sawblade-like teeth.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and "
"swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"湾曲したノコギリのような歯をもつ、大型二足歩行肉食恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Siats Stonehenge"
msgid_plural "Siats Stonehenges"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビシアッツ"

#. ~ Description for Siats Stonehenge
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shambling corpse of a large predatory bipedal dinosaur with long claws "
"and strong arms for grappling.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "長い爪と発達した腕をもつ、大型二足歩行肉食恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Alberta Anvil"
msgid_plural "Alberta Anvils"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビアルバートサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Alberta Anvil
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive jaws and grabbing claws lifted by an undead body bulging with "
"distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "巨大な顎と鋭い爪をもつゾンビ恐竜です。全身が傷で化膿しており、筋肉は異様に膨れ上がっています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Qianzhousaurus chéngqiáng"
msgid_plural "Qianzhousaurus chéngqiángs"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビキアンゾウサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Qianzhousaurus chéngqiáng
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive jaws on a long snout lifted by an undead body bulging with distended"
" muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "長く巨大な顎をもつゾンビ恐竜です。全身が傷で化膿しており、筋肉が異様に膨れ上がっています。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Rage Rex"
msgid_plural "Rage Rex"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビティラノサウルス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Rage Rex'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive pile of ragged, stinking flesh lifting enormous teeth.  Its entire"
" body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"巨大な牙をむき出しにした、酷い臭いを放つボロボロのゾンビ恐竜です。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Gruesome Gallimimus"
msgid_plural "Gruesome Gallimimus"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビガリミムス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Gruesome Gallimimus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with "
"tattered feathers and black, putrid liquid.  Its entire body bulges with "
"distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Nefarious Nothronychus"
msgid_plural "Nefarious Nothronychus"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビノトロニクス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Nefarious Nothronychus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with "
"tattered feathers and black, putrid liquid.  Long curved claws protrude from"
" its hands.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。手には湾曲した長い爪が生えています。。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Deino Destroyer"
msgid_plural "Deino Destroyers"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビデイノニクス"

#. ~ Description for Deino Destroyer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with "
"tattered feathers and black, putrid liquid.  Both feet brandish a large "
"sickle-shaped claw.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and "
"swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの羽毛と酷く臭う黒い液体で覆われた、フラフラと歩く中型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。両足から生えた大鎌のような爪を振り回して攻撃します。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Utah Hoodoo"
msgid_plural "Utah Hoodoos"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビユタラプトル"

#. ~ Description for Utah Hoodoo
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The swaying, hopping corpse of a large bipedal dinosaur with feathered arms,"
" a long tail, and long, sharp, scythe-shaped claws.  Its entire body bulges "
"with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"羽毛に覆われた腕、長い尾、大鎌のような鉤爪を持つ大型二足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。フラフラと動きまわり、時折飛び跳ねています。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spiked Dreadnaught"
msgid_plural "Spiked Dreadnaughts"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビアマルガサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Spiked Dreadnaught
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with two parallel rows of "
"tall spines down its neck and back and a whip-like tail.  Its entire body "
"bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"長い首と鞭のような尾をもち、背骨に沿って二列の発達した骨が並んでいる、巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Anabolic Apatosaurus"
msgid_plural "Anabolic Apatosaurus"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビアパトサウルス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Anabolic Apatosaurus'}
#. ~ Description for Brontosaurus Brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a long, whip-like "
"tail.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"長い首と鞭のように伸びた尻尾をもつ、巨大な四足歩行の恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Brontosaurus Brute"
msgid_plural "Brontosaurus Brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビブロントサウルス"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Flail Fiend"
msgid_plural "Flail Fiends"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビディプロドクス"

#. ~ Description for Flail Fiend
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a long, whip-like tail "
"and a tiny head with vacant white eyes.  Sways and staggers.  Its entire "
"body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"長い首と鞭のように伸びた尻尾をもつ、巨大な四足歩行の恐竜のゾンビです。目玉は残っておらず、フラフラと歩いています。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Zombie Freight Train"
msgid_plural "Zombie Freight Trains"
msgstr[0] "狂暴ゾンビアマラサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Zombie Freight Train
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a square head and even bulkier "
"frame.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering"
" wounds."
msgstr "頭部が四角く骨格が更に発達した、巨大な四足歩行恐竜のゾンビです。発達した全身の筋肉と化膿で膨れ上がった傷口によって、非常に大柄に見えます。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Brachiosaurus Brute"
msgid_plural "Brachiosaurus Brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴ゾンビブラキオサウルス"

#. ~ Description for Brachiosaurus Brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gigantic four-legged dinosaur corpse with longer forelegs and a whip-like "
