#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gives all of the debug spells at max level."
msgstr "デバッグ専用の呪文を最大レベルの状態で習得します。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wildshape: Fish"
msgstr "変化(魚)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wildshape: Fish'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are fish-like, making dexterous manipulation with your hands extremely "
"difficult."
msgstr "魚のような姿になっており、手を使った器用な動きは非常に困難です。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wildshape: Bear"
msgstr "変化(クマ)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wildshape: Bear'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are bear-like, granting you raw power in exchange for intelligence.  "
"Also, using a gun is extremely difficult."
msgstr "クマのような姿になっており、知性と引き換えに野性の力を手に入れました。銃を扱うのは非常に困難です。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wildshape: Deer"
msgstr "変化(シカ)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wildshape: Deer'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are deer-like, giving you the ability to move quickly and escape danger."
"  However, this takes a great toll on your body, and you don't think you "
"should maintain this form for long."
msgstr ""
"シカのような姿になっており、素早く動いて危機から逃れることができます。肉体に大きな負担がかかっており、この状態を長く維持するべきではないと感じています。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Demon Horns"
msgstr "悪魔の角"

#. ~ Description for Demon Horns
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Large ram horns curl around your ears on each side of your head.  Gives you "
"a headbutt attack and head protection."
msgstr "大きなヒツジの角が両耳の傍から生えています。頭突き攻撃が可能になり、頭部の装甲としても使えます。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Demon Hooves"
msgstr "悪魔の蹄"

#. ~ Description for Demon Hooves
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your toes have merged into cloven hooves, like that of a goat.  You also "
"have coarse brown fur from the waist down."
msgstr "つま先から下が、ヤギのような蹄の生えた足に変異しています。更に、腰から下が粗い茶色の毛皮に覆われています。"

#. ~ Description for Demonic Possession
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are possessed by a greater demon, giving you great strength and combat "
"abilities but reducing your fine motor control skills.  This gives you a "
"slower crafting speed and the inability to cast spells."
msgstr ""
"高位の悪魔に憑りつかれたことで、強大な力と戦闘技術を得ましたが、細かな作業は困難になっています。製作速度が遅くなり、呪文詠唱ができない状態です。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Demon Claws"
msgstr "悪魔の鉤爪"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Demon Skin"
msgstr "悪魔の肌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Demon Skin'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your skin is crimson."
msgstr "肌の色が真っ赤です。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Goat Tail"
msgstr "ヤギの尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Goat Tail'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You have a short, stubby goat tail."
msgstr "短くちっぽけなヤギの尻尾が生えています。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Made Of Sugar"
msgstr "砂糖の身体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Made Of Sugar'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are literally made of sugar."
msgstr "文字通り身体が砂糖でできています。"

#: lang/json/npc_class_from_json.py
