#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Handy Man"
msgstr "便利屋"

#. ~ Profession (Handy Man) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a local hardware store, and you did plenty of home "
"renovations yourself.  Now you look out at the horizon of a ruined world, "
"and wonder - are your meager skills, and the few supplies you grabbed on the"
" way out, sufficient to help rebuild?"
msgstr ""
"金物屋で働き、多くの家を修復してきました。今、目の前に広がるのは廃墟と化した街並みだけです。未熟な腕と手元に残るわずかな資材を手に、果たして、この荒廃した世界を修復できるのでしょうか？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Handy Woman"
msgstr "便利屋"

#. ~ Profession (Handy Woman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a local hardware store, and you did plenty of home "
"renovations yourself.  Now you look out at the horizon of a ruined world, "
"and wonder - are your meager skills, and the few supplies you grabbed on the"
" way out, sufficient to help rebuild?"
msgstr ""
"金物屋で働き、多くの家を修復してきました。今、目の前に広がるのは廃墟と化した街並みだけです。未熟な腕と手元に残るわずかな資材を手に、果たして、この荒廃した世界を修復できるのでしょうか？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "トラック運転手"

#. ~ Profession (male Trucker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"大型トラックを走らせて車道を支配していました。暴動が起きたため、車に飛び乗り安全な場所まで移動しましたが、今や世界に反抗しているのは、自分自身と愛車だけです。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "トラック運転手"

#. ~ Profession (female Trucker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"大型トラックを走らせて車道を支配していました。暴動が起きたため、車に飛び乗り安全な場所まで移動しましたが、今や世界に反抗しているのは、自分自身と愛車だけです。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Day Driver"
msgstr "運転手"

#. ~ Profession (male Day Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving and making a living with it.  On your way to pick up "
"someone with your car, you start to notice all the chaos happening around "
"you.  Not wanting to be a part of it, you took a long detour to safety, only"
" to find yourself in a different place.  All that's left is your car."
msgstr ""
"大好きな車の運転を生業としています。誰かを車で迎えに行く途中で、周囲の混乱にようやく気付きました。このままではいけないと思い、遠回りして安全な場所へ行こうとしましたが、気付くと知らない場所に来ていました。見覚えがあるのは自分の車だけです。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Day Driver"
msgstr "運転手"

#. ~ Profession (female Day Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving and making a living with it.  On your way to pick up "
"someone with your car, you start to notice all the chaos happening around "
"you.  Not wanting to be a part of it, you took a long detour to safety, only"
" to find yourself in a different place.  All that's left is your car."
msgstr ""
"大好きな車の運転を生業としています。誰かを車で迎えに行く途中で、周囲の混乱にようやく気付きました。このままではいけないと思い、遠回りして安全な場所へ行こうとしましたが、気付くと知らない場所に来ていました。見覚えがあるのは自分の車だけです。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "消防機関員"

#. ~ Profession (male EMT Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving as much as you love extinguishing fire and helping the "
"wounded, where every second counts.  On your way to respond to an emergency "
"call with your firetruck, you encounter chaos in the city, recklessness and "
"violence are plentiful.  Not wanting to use of the streets covered in "
"burning trash and debris, you took a long detour to your fire station, only "
"to find yourself unsure of the route back.  Looks like the only emergency "
"you will respond to will be your own."
msgstr ""
"消火や負傷者の救護と同じくらい、車の運転を愛しています。消防車で緊急通報に応じる途中で街での騒乱に遭遇し、数多くの蛮行と暴力を目にしました。燃えているゴミや瓦礫に覆われた通りを避けるために長い回り道をして消防署へ帰ろうとしましたが、道に迷ってしまいました。今唯一対応できる緊急通報は、自分自身から発されています。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "消防機関員"

#. ~ Profession (female EMT Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving as much as you love extinguishing fire and helping the "
"wounded, where every second counts.  On your way to respond to an emergency "
"call with your firetruck, you encounter chaos in the city, recklessness and "
"violence are plentiful.  Not wanting to use of the streets covered in "
"burning trash and debris, you took a long detour to your fire station, only "
"to find yourself unsure of the route back.  Looks like the only emergency "
"you will respond to will be your own."
msgstr ""
