#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Serviceman"
msgstr "修理工"

#. ~ Profession (male Serviceman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Employed by a large company, you performed services directly at annoying "
"customer's homes and also troubleshoot problems with their devices.  After "
"you finally finished replacing the 'wifi-cable' you finally were able to go "
"back to your company, along the road back you notice all the chaos happening"
" around you.  Not wanting to get in the way of angry looking protesters, you"
" took an old neglected side road, only to find yourself low on gas in a "
"truly deserted place.  Couldn't this all just happen before you finished "
"your work?"
msgstr ""
"大企業に雇われ、うるさい顧客の自宅へ車で出向いて対応し、その場で機械の修理をする仕事をしていました。「Wi-"
"Fiケーブル」の交換がやっと終わり、ようやく会社に戻れると思っていたのに、帰社途中で周囲の混乱に気付きました。憤慨した顔つきの抗議者たちを邪魔しないように忘れ去られた古い脇道に入りましたが、人気のないところまで来てガス欠になってしまいました。いつになったら退勤できるのでしょうか？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Serviceman"
msgstr "修理工"

#. ~ Profession (female Serviceman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Employed by a large company, you performed services directly at annoying "
"customer's homes and also troubleshoot problems with their devices.  After "
"you finally finished replacing the 'wifi-cable' you finally were able to go "
"back to your company, along the road back you notice all the chaos happening"
" around you.  Not wanting to get in the way of angry looking protesters, you"
" took an old neglected side road, only to find yourself low on gas in a "
"truly deserted place.  Couldn't this all just happen before you finished "
"your work?"
msgstr ""
"大企業に雇われ、うるさい顧客の自宅へ車で出向いて対応し、その場で機械の修理をする仕事をしていました。「Wi-"
"Fiケーブル」の交換がやっと終わり、ようやく会社に戻れると思っていたのに、帰社途中で周囲の混乱に気付きました。憤慨した顔つきの抗議者たちを邪魔しないように忘れ去られた古い脇道に入りましたが、人気のないところまで来てガス欠になってしまいました。いつになったら退勤できるのでしょうか？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "バス運転士"

#. ~ Profession (male Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are making a living with delivering noisy brats to their schools, where "
"you wish with every delivery, that they don't break a seat or window for "
"you.  On your way to pick up the first row of brats, you start to notice all"
" the chaos happening around you.  By the time you arrive at the station, all"
" the brats look like zombies, so you took a long detour to safety, only to "
"find yourself in a different place.  At last you have been freed of the "
"hellish noises they release, but new ones are on the merge."
msgstr ""
"騒々しいガキ共を学校へ届けることで生計を立てており、座席や窓を壊されないかとハラハラする毎日を送っていました。最初の停留所へ向かう途中で周囲で起きている混乱に気付き、停留所へ着いてみるとガキ共が皆ゾンビのように呻いていました。遠回りしてなんとか安全な場所へたどり着き、地獄のような騒々しさから解放されましたが、代わりに馴染みのない音が近づいてきました。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "バス運転士"

#. ~ Profession (female Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are making a living with delivering noisy brats to their schools, where "
"you wish with every delivery, that they don't break a seat or window for "
"you.  On your way to pick up the first row of brats, you start to notice all"
" the chaos happening around you.  By the time you arrive at the station, all"
" the brats look like zombies, so you took a long detour to safety, only to "
"find yourself in a different place.  At last you have been freed of the "
"hellish noises they release, but new ones are on the merge."
msgstr ""
"騒々しいガキ共を学校へ届けることで生計を立てており、座席や窓を壊されないかとハラハラする毎日を送っていました。最初の停留所へ向かう途中で周囲で起きている混乱に気付き、停留所へ着いてみるとガキ共が皆ゾンビのように呻いていました。遠回りしてなんとか安全な場所へたどり着き、地獄のような騒々しさから解放されましたが、代わりに馴染みのない音が近づいてきました。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "パトカー乗務警官"

#. ~ Profession (male Police Interceptor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As on-duty officer, you received the call and got ready to respond to the "
"robbery with your patrol car.  After arriving at the scene, it was soon you "
"who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life and car.  "
"No one responds on the radio anymore either.  Who's going to respect your "
"authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"強盗被害の通報を受けてパトカーで現場に向かう勤務中の警官でしたが、すぐに自分自身が救援を求める羽目になり、パトカーでなんとか命からがら逃げ出しました。もはや無線からの応答はありません。このバッジの威光を保証する政府が消えてしまったら、誰が警察の権威を保証してくれるのでしょうか？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "パトカー乗務警官"

#. ~ Profession (female Police Interceptor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As on-duty officer, you received the call and got ready to respond to the "
"robbery with your patrol car.  After arriving at the scene, it was soon you "
"who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life and car.  "
"No one responds on the radio anymore either.  Who's going to respect your "
"authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"強盗被害の通報を受けてパトカーで現場に向かう勤務中の警官でしたが、すぐに自分自身が救援を求める羽目になり、パトカーでなんとか命からがら逃げ出しました。もはや無線からの応答はありません。このバッジの威光を保証する政府が消えてしまったら、誰が警察の権威を保証してくれるのでしょうか？"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "民兵"

#. ~ Profession (male Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You’ve long since prepared yourself for this outcome.  You, alongside a band"
" of compatriots, started a hideout in the woods from which to launch looting"
" raids on a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went poorly, leaving you last "
"alive amongst your former comrades.  Every breath you take now is an act of "
"rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"この事態に備えて長い間準備してきました。仲間と協力して森の中に隠れ家を作り、自作のピックアップトラックに乗って略奪を開始しました。しかし、何度目かの襲撃が失敗に終わり、仲間は皆死んでしまいました。生きて呼吸をしていることこそ、絶望的で残酷な世界に対する反抗です。希望の炎を絶やしてはなりません。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "民兵"

#. ~ Profession (female Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You’ve long since prepared yourself for this outcome.  You, alongside a band"
" of compatriots, started a hideout in the woods from which to launch looting"
" raids on a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went poorly, leaving you last "
"alive amongst your former comrades.  Every breath you take now is an act of "
"rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"この事態に備えて長い間準備してきました。仲間と協力して森の中に隠れ家を作り、自作のピックアップトラックに乗って略奪を開始しました。しかし、何度目かの襲撃が失敗に終わり、仲間は皆死んでしまいました。生きて呼吸をしていることこそ、絶望的で残酷な世界に対する反抗です。希望の炎を絶やしてはなりません。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Park Ranger"
msgstr "自然保護官"

#. ~ Profession (male Park Ranger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a park ranger, most things you usually do is maintain the park, teach "
"people how to not start a fire in the forest, patrol, and check out stuff on"
" your daily to-do list.  After arriving at a deserted camp with notes left "
"from survivors, you took upon heeding their warning, and packed at your "
"station with some supplies alongside your pickup, just before the station "
"was overrun as well."
msgstr ""
"自然保護官としての主な仕事は、公園の管理、山火事防止の指導、パトロール、日々のやることリストの確認です。ある時、荒れ果てたキャンプ地に残されたメモを見つけました。そこに書かれた警告文に従い、仕事場が襲撃される前に物資をもってピックアップトラックで逃げ出してきました。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Park Ranger"
msgstr "自然保護官"

#. ~ Profession (female Park Ranger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a park ranger, most things you usually do is maintain the park, teach "
"people how to not start a fire in the forest, patrol, and check out stuff on"
" your daily to-do list.  After arriving at a deserted camp with notes left "
"from survivors, you took upon heeding their warning, and packed at your "
"station with some supplies alongside your pickup, just before the station "
"was overrun as well."
msgstr ""
"自然保護官としての主な仕事は、公園の管理、山火事防止の指導、パトロール、日々のやることリストの確認です。ある時、荒れ果てたキャンプ地に残されたメモを見つけました。そこに書かれた警告文に従い、仕事場が襲撃される前に物資をもってピックアップトラックで逃げ出してきました。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "木こり"

#. ~ Profession (male Lumberjack) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr "僕は木こり、よく働き、よく眠る！　災厄の前は木を伐って暮らしていました。だから気付けたのです、どうやら死体共は木ほど頑丈ではないようだと。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "木こり"

#. ~ Profession (female Lumberjack) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
