msgstr "鉱山作業員はマイナーな職業ではありません！水筒は空、ジャックハンマーはガス欠、採掘用ヘルメットの電池も残り1本です..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Demolition Expert"
msgstr "解体工事専門家"

#. ~ Profession (male Demolition Expert) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
"job: blowing stuff up.  The Cataclysm means you're finally allowed to do it "
"full time."
msgstr "事が起こる以前は、夢だった爆破解体を仕事にして、人生を楽しんでいました。これからはフルタイムで爆破解体が楽しめそうです。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Demolition Expert"
msgstr "解体工事専門家"

#. ~ Profession (female Demolition Expert) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
