#. ~ Profession (male Hazmat Unit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the aliens after it was put down.  When "
"their friends showed up in force, you knew this was out of your job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"湧いて出たエイリアンの一体を解剖するために配備されました。検体の仲間が大挙して攻めてくるなんて、どうして事前に説明してくれなかったのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Profession (female Hazmat Unit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the aliens after it was put down.  When "
"their friends showed up in force, you knew this was out of your job "
