#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fireplace, counter, and some pots and pans in the central building will "
"allow us to cook simple recipes and organize hunting expeditions."
msgstr "中央の建物に暖炉、カウンター、鍋やフライパンがあれば、簡単なレシピの製作や狩猟遠征の拠点として活用できそうです。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "central fireplace"
msgstr "暖炉(中央区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We need a butchery rack to maximize the harvest from our hunting and "
"trapping efforts."
msgstr "狩猟や罠猟の戦利品から最大限の物資を得るには、食肉処理用のラックが必要です。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "central butchery rack"
msgstr "食肉処理ラック(中央区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tool rack in the central building will give us a place to store tools."
msgstr "中央の建物に工具棚を置けば、工具を適切に保管できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "central tool rack"
msgstr "工具棚(中央区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Setting up some tables and chairs will make the central building into a "
"dining area, and we can also use them as a workspace to organize the camp."
msgstr "中央の建物にテーブルや椅子を複数置けば、食事や拠点構築の作業をするスペースとして活用できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "central dining hall"
msgstr "食堂(中央区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "south dining hall"
msgstr "食堂(南区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wood stove, counter, and some pots and pans in the south half of the "
"central building will allow us to cook simple recipes and organize hunting "
"expeditions.  The stove will be more efficient than a fireplace."
msgstr ""
"中央の建物の南側に薪ストーブ、カウンター、鍋やフライパンがあれば、簡単なレシピの製作や狩猟遠征の拠点として活用できそうです。ストーブは暖炉よりも効率的です。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "south wood stove"
msgstr "薪ストーブ(南区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Digging a well will give us easy access to water."
msgstr "井戸を掘ればもっと簡単に水を入手できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north water well"
msgstr "井戸(北区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Digging a root cellar will give us a way to preserve food."
msgstr "貯蔵穴を掘れば食料の保管に役立ちます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north root cellar"
msgstr "貯蔵穴(北区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We could build a radio tower to improve the range of our radios."
msgstr "電波塔を建てれば、無線機の通状況が改善します。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north radio tower"
msgstr "電波塔(北区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Adding a console to control the radio tower will help with recruiting more "
"survivors."
msgstr "電波塔を制御するコンソールを置けば、より多くの生存者を呼び寄せられます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north radio console"
msgstr "電波制御装置(北区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the north edge of the camp would provide some defense"
" and generate building materials."
msgstr "拠点の北端に沿って塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north trench"
msgstr "塹壕(北区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the south edge of the camp would provide some defense"
" and generate building materials."
msgstr "拠点の南端に沿って塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "south trench"
msgstr "塹壕(南区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the northeast corner of the camp would provide some "
"defense and generate building materials.  If we have solid buildings all "
"along the east side of the camp, we would only need to dig the trench long "
"enough to reach the buildings."
msgstr ""
"拠点の北東の隅に塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。拠点の東側に堅牢な建物が建っているなら、その壁で守れない箇所にのみ塹壕を掘るだけで済みます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "northeast trench"
msgstr "塹壕(北東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the northwest corner of the camp would provide some "
"defense and generate building materials.  If we have solid buildings all "
"along the west side of the camp, we would only need to dig the trench long "
"enough to reach the buildings."
msgstr ""
"拠点の北西の隅に塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。拠点の西側に堅牢な建物が建っているなら、その壁で守れない箇所にのみ塹壕を掘るだけで済みます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "northwest trench"
msgstr "塹壕(北西区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the southeast corner of the camp would provide some "
"defense and generate building materials.  If we have solid buildings all "
"along the east side of the camp, we would only need to dig the trench long "
"enough to reach the buildings."
msgstr ""
"拠点の南東の隅に塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。拠点の東側に堅牢な建物が建っているなら、その壁で守れない箇所にのみ塹壕を掘るだけで済みます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "southeast trench"
msgstr "塹壕(南東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the southwest corner of the camp would provide some "
"defense and generate building materials.  If we have solid buildings all "
"along the west side of the camp, we would only need to dig the trench long "
"enough to reach the buildings."
msgstr ""
"拠点の南西の隅に塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。拠点の西側に堅牢な建物が建っているなら、その壁で守れない箇所にのみ塹壕を掘るだけで済みます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "southwest trench"
msgstr "塹壕(南西区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the east edge of the camp would provide some defense "
"and generate building materials.  We'll need to run the trench the length of"
" the camp if we don't have solid buildings all along the east side."
msgstr ""
"拠点の東端に沿って塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。拠点の東側に堅牢な建物が建っていない場合は、端から端まで塹壕を掘る必要があります。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "east trench"
msgstr "塹壕(東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the west edge of the camp would provide some defense "
"and generate building materials.  We'll need to run the trench the length of"
" the camp if we don't have solid buildings all along the west side."
msgstr ""
"拠点の西端に沿って塹壕を掘れば、防衛力が高まり建築資材も確保できます。拠点の西側に堅牢な建物が建っていない場合は、端から端まで塹壕を掘る必要があります。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "west trench"
msgstr "塹壕(西区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We need some shelter, so build half of a log shack with a wooden roof on the"
" northeast side of the camp"
msgstr "避難シェルターが必要です。拠点の北東に、木製の屋根がある丸太壁の小屋を建てましょう。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "northeast shack"
msgstr "小屋(北東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We should use logs to expand the shelter so we have space for another bed."
msgstr "もっと寝床を広げるために、丸太壁の避難シェルターを広げましょう。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "expand northeast shack"
msgstr "小屋拡張(北東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We should use logs to finish the northeast shack."
msgstr "北東の丸太壁の小屋を完成させましょう。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "finish northeast shack"
msgstr "小屋完成(北東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We should expand our housing by putting up a log building on the east side, "
"which we can also use as part of the central building."
msgstr "更に住居を広げるために、東側に丸太壁の建物を建てましょう。建設した壁は中央の部屋の壁の一部として利用できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "east shack"
msgstr "小屋(東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We should expand our housing by adding a log room on the east side, which we"
" can also use as part of the central building."
msgstr "更に住居を広げるために、東側に丸太壁の個室を増やしましょう。建設した壁は中央の部屋の壁の一部として利用できます。"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "east room"
msgstr "個室(東区画)"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
