msgid "How did you survive those first few days?"
msgstr "最初の数日間はどうやって生き延びたんだ？"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Was it rough surviving thus far?"
msgstr "今までどうやって無事に乗り切ったんだ？"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "How do you think we ended up here?  What even happened?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなことになった？一体何が起きたのかな？"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "What's going on?  Like, big picture, what the hell happened?"
msgstr "どうなってるんだ？世界で何が起きているんだ？"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "What do you think the cataclysm even was?"
msgstr "結局大変動って何だったんだろうな？"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "So how do you think the end of the world happened?"
msgstr "世界の終焉はどのようにして訪れたんだろうか？"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Have you heard anything about how the apocalypse came about?"
msgstr "どのようにして世界が崩壊したのか、何か聞いたことはないか？"

