#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A flyer for some kind of candy.  It shows a picture of a gleaming human made"
" of smooth candy looking at you in terror.  \"SugarKin the first life-size "
"human candy!  Are you a real monster?  Will you be able to devour it all?\""
msgstr ""
"キャンディーか何かのチラシです。恐ろしげにあなたを見つめる、滑らかな飴で作られた人間が描かれています。「シュガーキン(砂糖の血族)は史上初の等身大ヒューマンキャンディーです！あなたは真のモンスターですか？これを食べ尽くすことが出来ますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hello?\""
msgstr "「やぁ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Papaya!\""
msgstr "「パパイヤ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who's there?\""
msgstr "「そこにいるのは誰？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can you help me?\""
msgstr "「手伝ってくれるかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Over here!\""
msgstr "「こっちだ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can you repeat that?\""
msgstr "「もう一度言ってくれる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're just copying me, aren't you?\""
msgstr "「君は...僕の真似をしているんだね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm not afraid of you!\""
msgstr "「お前なんて怖くないぞ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come here!\""
msgstr "「来てくれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, don't!\""
msgstr "「お願いだ、やめてくれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a horrified scream!"
msgstr "[恐怖に満ちた悲鳴]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a little girl's wailing!"
msgstr "[少女が泣き叫ぶ声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"So, what is this thing supposed to be, exactly?\""
msgstr "「ええと、一体これは何だ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Uncategorized object seven-seven-three-four.\""
msgstr "「未分類オブジェクト、7-7-3-4」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We found it in a wreckage, barely alive.  Not the first one, either.\""
msgstr "「瓦礫の中で発見したが、かろうじて生きている。最初に発見したものとも違うな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Area nineteen has a few in cold storage.\""
msgstr "「エリア19には、複数の冷蔵倉庫がある」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Mommy, help!\""
msgstr "「お母さーん、助けてぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're still trying to figure out what makes it tick.\""
msgstr "「こいつがまだ動けるかどうか調べているところだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're not even sure what it is.\""
msgstr "「これは何だ、さっぱりわからん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The cell structure is unlike any we've ever seen.\""
msgstr "「こんな細胞の構造は見たことが無い」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It does seem to have some form of higher level brain functioning.\""
msgstr "「より高度な脳機能を持っているようだな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Problem solving, memory retention, that sort of thing.\""
msgstr "「問題の解決や、記憶の保持、そういったことだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There appear to be some anomalous aspects to the mimicry.\""
msgstr "「変則的な擬態機能があるようですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Members of the species have some kind of neurocognitive link.\""
msgstr "「この生物は、認知神経をリンクできるようだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"This one's repeating phrases that the previous specimen was exposed to.\""
msgstr "「繰り返している単語は、前回の被験者の言葉ですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a child shrieking!"
msgstr "[子供の悲鳴]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh God, my leg, Oh God!\""
msgstr "「なんてことだ、脚が...おおぉ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a long cry of agony!"
msgstr "[苦痛に満ちた叫び声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You mean it's not just parroting us?\""
msgstr "「これがただのオウム返しではないと言うのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's parroting us, but we're uncertain as to how or why.\""
msgstr "「確かに言葉を真似ていますが、何故、どんな方法で、ということが分かりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It may be a mechanism for attracting prey.\""
msgstr "「獲物を引き寄せるための機能、という可能性もあります」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It could even be a way of trying to scare us off.\""
msgstr "「もしくは、私たちを追い払おうとしているのかも」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We just don't know.\""
msgstr "「分からないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "an anguished wail!"
msgstr "[苦悶に満ちた悲鳴]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're gonna rot in hell for this!\""
msgstr "「地獄に落ちろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You hear me!?\""
msgstr "「聞いているのか！？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're gonna rot in hell, you pieces of shit!\""
msgstr "「くたばりやがれ、くそったれが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Like we said, we have no idea what it's thinking.\""
msgstr "「言った通り、何を考えているのかさっぱりだろう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is that glass electrified?\""
msgstr "「あのガラスには電流でも流れているのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Why don't you touch it and find out?\""
msgstr "「触ってみてはどうだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Of course it is.\""
msgstr "「ええ、良いですよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What'll happen if the power goes out?\""
msgstr "「もし停電になったらどうなるんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't worry about it.\""
msgstr "「それについては心配要りませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't worry.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There are seven backup generators.\""
msgstr "「予備発電機を7台用意しています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"And what if all the backups fail?\""
msgstr "「予備もダメになったら？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We'd have to terminate the specimen.\""
msgstr "「試験を中止する必要があるでしょうね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The glass alone won't keep us safe for very long.\""
msgstr "「ガラス1枚だけでずっと安全が保障されるとは思えないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That fuckin' thing is horrible, man, it gives me the creeps.\""
msgstr "「あぁ畜生、恐ろしいよ、本当に、ゾッとする」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's probably more scared of us than we are of it.\""
msgstr "「きっと我々がアレを恐れる以上に、アレも我々の事を恐れていますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Somehow, I doubt that.\""
msgstr "「なんだか、信じられないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, we got other specimens that could withstand a grenade.\""
msgstr "「やあ、手榴弾にも耐える別の検体を捕獲しましたよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"And that's supposed to comfort me?\""
msgstr "「で、それは私を満足させてくれるのかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"At least we know they can die.\""
msgstr "「少なくともあいつらは殺すことができる」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"U-O Seven-Seven-Three-Four.\""
msgstr "「U-O 7-7-3-4」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Individual instances of U-O Seven-Seven-Three-Four.\""
msgstr "「U-O 7-7-3-4の個別試験」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"To be kept in a standard biohazardous containment chamber.\""
msgstr "「標準的な生物災害用格納施設に保管」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Until such time as more permanent arrangements are made.\""
msgstr "「期間は、より恒久的な事態が発生するまで」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shows a noted preference for human brain tissue.\""
msgstr "「人間の脳組織に対する顕著な反応」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Destroy the specimen if it begins to interact with the lock.\""
msgstr "「施錠部分に接触しようとした場合、速やかに処分すること」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Kill them all and let God sort them out!\""
msgstr "「皆殺しにしろ。仕分けは神に任せろ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I watched a snail crawl along the edge of a straight razor.\""
msgstr "「カタツムリを見ていた。カミソリの刃の上を這っている」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've seen horrors, horrors that you've seen.\""
msgstr "「私は地獄を見た。君が見た地獄を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I love the smell of napalm in the morning.\""
msgstr "「朝のナパーム弾の臭いは格別だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is the way the fuckin' world ends.\""
msgstr "「これが、この世の終わりだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Look at this fuckin' shit we're in, man.\""
msgstr "「まるで地獄じゃないか」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Every man has got a breaking point.\""
msgstr "「だれにだって限界がある」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'ma cut those fuckin' tentacles off, bitch!\""
msgstr "「その触手を叩き切ってやる、クソが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Watch you bleed out!\""
msgstr "「黙って死にな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I wonder if it understands us.\""
msgstr "「アレは私たちの事を理解しているんだろうか」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do you understand what I'm saying?\""
msgstr "「私の言っていることが分かりますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Look, it's responding!\""
msgstr "「見ろ、返事をした！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That's the first time it moved all morning.\""
msgstr "「午前中ずっと動いていたのは初めてですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm certain it's trying to understand us.\""
msgstr "「私たちの事を理解しようとしている。きっとそうだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm not convinced it can actually comprehend us.\""
msgstr "「アレが私たちを理解できるとは、到底思えません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's just repeating us.\""
msgstr "「言葉を真似してるぞ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Just being an alien creature doesn't mean it's intelligent.\""
msgstr "「地球外生命体だからといって、知性があるとは限りませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Just because it doesn't look like you doesn't mean that it isn't.\""
msgstr "「しかし、外見が僕らとかけ離れているからといって、知性が無いとは限らない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please open the door and enter the cell.\""
msgstr "「ドアを開けて、部屋に入ってください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Would it react differently with a child?\""
msgstr "「子供に反応するかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Experiments to determine extent of cognitive abilities still underway.\""
msgstr "「認知能力の程度を調べる実験が進行中です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Subject has so far displayed a total lack of empathy toward human "
"suffering.\""
msgstr "「これまでの実験によれば、検体は人間の苦しみに対する共感が完全に欠如しています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I got a round trip ticket.\""
msgstr "「往復チケットを買ったよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How's your mom doing?\""
msgstr "「ママは何してる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How's your dad doing?\""
msgstr "「パパは何してる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I love you.\""
msgstr "「愛しているよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "「私も愛してるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Just a little.\""
msgstr "「ほんの少しだけね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Only a few more days 'til the weekend.\""
msgstr "「もうちょっとで週末だよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do you smoke?\""
msgstr "「タバコは吸うかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You're new here, aren't you?\""
msgstr "「見ない顔だね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do you like it here?\""
msgstr "「ここは気に入ったかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It won't hurt a bit.\""
msgstr "「全然痛くないよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That was a long time ago.\""
msgstr "「ずいぶん経ったな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Does it scare you?\""
msgstr "「怖がってる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't worry, it can't hurt us.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫、私たちに危害は与えないよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What are you afraid will happen?\""
msgstr "「何を怖がっているの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Anything else?\""
msgstr "「他に何か？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You think they're the same sex?\""
msgstr "「あいつらの性別は皆同じだと思う？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do they even have sex?\""
msgstr "「そもそも性別があるの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can I see your phone?\""
msgstr "「ちょっと携帯電話見せて？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You got a dollar I can borrow?\""
msgstr "「お金貸してくれない？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you busy at the moment?\""
msgstr "「今忙しい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you busy later?\""
msgstr "「このあと暇？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you busy tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜ひま？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you free tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜空いてる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you going to the party tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜パーティーしない？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you going to help them?\""
msgstr "「あの人たちを助けようとしてるの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you alone?\""
msgstr "「一人ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you hungry?\""
msgstr "「お腹が空いたのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm hungry.\""
msgstr "「腹が減った...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Go ahead.\""
msgstr "「先に行ってて」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have a good time.\""
msgstr "「楽しんできてね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you eaten yet?\""
msgstr "「まだ食べてないの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is it supposed to rain tomorrow?\""
msgstr "「明日は雨かな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Okay.\""
msgstr "「了解だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good.\""
msgstr "「いいね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Great.\""
msgstr "「素晴らしい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fantastic.\""
msgstr "「最高だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"God damn it.\""
msgstr "「ちっ、しまった」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"God damn it!\""
msgstr "「くそっ、しまった！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Damn it.\""
msgstr "「しまった」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Damn it!\""
msgstr "「しまった！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fuck.\""
msgstr "「くそっ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shit.\""
msgstr "「ちくしょう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fuck!\""
msgstr "「くそったれが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shit!\""
msgstr "「ちくしょう！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fuckin' piece of garbage.\""
msgstr "「くそったれ、このゴミ屑が」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I need a new lab coat.\""
msgstr "「新しい白衣が必要なんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Excellent.\""
msgstr "「素晴らしいな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Excuse me.\""
msgstr "「ちょっとすみません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good morning.\""
msgstr "「おはよう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good afternoon.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good evening.\""
msgstr "「こんばんは」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good night.\""
msgstr "「おやすみ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Good luck.\""
msgstr "「幸運を祈るよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can I help you?\""
msgstr "「何か手伝える事は？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you seeing anyone?\""
msgstr "「君...付き合ってる人はいるか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Forget it.\""
msgstr "「気にしないでくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How long were you two together?\""
msgstr "「付き合い始めてどれぐらい経ったかな？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Give me a call later.\""
msgstr "「後で電話してくれよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Call me.\""
msgstr "「電話してね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"From time to time.\""
msgstr "「時々な」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We have a serious situation here.\""
msgstr "「ここは深刻な状況だよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Call the police.\""
msgstr "「警察を呼んでくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Call an ambulance.\""
msgstr "「救急車を呼んでくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Get me the White House.\""
msgstr "「ホワイトハウスに連れて行ってくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you feeling all right?\""
msgstr "「具合は大丈夫かい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I think I'll live.\""
msgstr "「何とか生きてはいる...と思うよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I think I need to see a doctor.\""
msgstr "「医者に診て貰う必要がありそうだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is everything all right?\""
msgstr "「何か問題はないかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm okay, don't worry about me.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫だ、問題ない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's just a scratch.\""
msgstr "「こんなのかすり傷さ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got a headache.\""
msgstr "「頭痛がする」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm fine.\""
msgstr "「平気だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you sure?\""
msgstr "「本当ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Positive.\""
msgstr "「まったくだな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Affirmative.\""
msgstr "「その通りだな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Negative.\""
msgstr "「違うな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Sorry.\""
msgstr "「すまない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Happy Birthday!\""
msgstr "「ハッピーバースデー！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you ever been to California?\""
msgstr "「カリフォルニアに行ったことある？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What time do you get off?\""
msgstr "「いつ出発するんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We should hit up the shooting range later.\""
msgstr "「もっと射程距離を伸ばさないと」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm heading to the pool after work.\""
msgstr "「仕事が終わってプールに行くところだよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have a good trip.\""
msgstr "「良い旅を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Where did you come from?\""
msgstr "「君はどこから来たんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you been waiting long?\""
msgstr "「大分待ったかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you done this before?\""
msgstr "「前にこれをやった事があるかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hello.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "「助けて！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Here it is.\""
msgstr "「ここにあるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got family coming tomorrow.\""
msgstr "「家族が帰ってくる日を待っているんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do I use this?\""
msgstr "「これはどうやって使うんですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do you know?\""
msgstr "「何で分かるんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How long have you been here?\""
msgstr "「どれだけここにいたんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How many languages do you speak?\""
msgstr "「君は何ヶ国語話せるの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How many people?\""
msgstr "「何人いるんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much were these earrings?\""
msgstr "「このイヤリングはいくらしたんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much do I owe you?\""
msgstr "「おいくらですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much will it cost?\""
msgstr "「料金はいくらですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How much would you like?\""
msgstr "「値段はいくらが希望なんだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How old are you?\""
msgstr "「何歳ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How tall is it?\""
msgstr "「どれくらいするんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How was the movie?\""
msgstr "「映画はどうだった？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How was your trip?\""
msgstr "「旅はどうだった？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How's it going?\""
msgstr "「調子はどうだい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"See you later.\""
msgstr "「また後で」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"See you tonight.\""
msgstr "「また今夜ね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I got this weird rash a few days ago.\""
msgstr "「数日前から異様な発疹が出てきたんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let me have a look at it.\""
msgstr "「ちょっと見せてみてよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"When did you find out?\""
msgstr "「何か見つけたかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Seven o'clock.\""
msgstr "「7時だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Nobody is helping us.\""
msgstr "「誰も助けてくれない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're on our own.\""
msgstr "「自力で頑張ろう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're all alone.\""
msgstr "「人は皆1人ぼっちさ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We should split into groups of two each.\""
msgstr "「二手に分かれよう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It can't follow all of us.\""
msgstr "「これなら追いつかれない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Be careful out there.\""
msgstr "「あたりに注意して」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There you are.\""
msgstr "「さあどうぞ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've been looking all over for you.\""
msgstr "「ずいぶん捜したんだよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's looking for us.\""
msgstr "「私たちを探してるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's faster than us.\""
msgstr "「僕らより素早いね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's looking right at us.\""
msgstr "「こっちを見てるよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's heading right for us!\""
msgstr "「こっちに向かってくる！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can you swim?\""
msgstr "「君は泳げるかい？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't do that.\""
msgstr "「やめてよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You hear that?\""
msgstr "「聞こえたか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Be quiet.\""
msgstr "「静かにしろ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Look out!\""
msgstr "「気をつけろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Run!\""
msgstr "「逃げろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hurry!\""
msgstr "「急げ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No!\""
msgstr "「駄目だ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'll never forget you.\""
msgstr "「決して君を忘れないよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Take his gun, we're going to need it.\""
msgstr "「彼の銃を貰っていこう、きっと役に立つ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"How do we get out of here?\""
msgstr "「どうやったら脱出できるんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This place is like a maze.\""
msgstr "「まるで迷路だな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh God, I'm the only one left.\""
msgstr "「何てこった、置いてけぼりにされた」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, I don't want to die.\""
msgstr "「やめて、死にたくない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Mom.\""
msgstr "「母さん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Mom, I miss you.\""
msgstr "「母さん、会えなくて寂しいよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Me go, you stay.\""
msgstr "「ワタシ、イク。キミ、クルナ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, God.\""
msgstr "「神様、どうか私を許して下さい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a gurgling sound."
msgstr "[水が詰まったようなゴボゴボという音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a choking sound."
msgstr "[苦悶に咽ぶ声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a snapping sound."
msgstr "パチン。"

#. ~ Beeper sound
#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/vehicle_use.cpp
msgid "beep!"
msgstr "ビー！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/mattack_actors.cpp
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "beep-beep-beep!"
msgstr "ビー！ビー！ビー！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "BEEP!"
msgstr "ビーッ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a loud hiss."
msgstr "シューッ。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a loud crackling noise."
msgstr "パチッ。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/ranged.cpp
msgid "bang!"
msgstr "バァン！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a klaxon blaring!"
msgstr "[騒々しいクラクション！]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"EMERGENCY, EMERGENCY!\""
msgstr "「緊急事態発生、緊急事態発生！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a static hissing sound."
msgstr "[連続した摩擦音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That creepy abandoned post-apocalyptic lab complex looks safe…\""
msgstr "「滅亡後の放棄された研究施設みたいで不気味だが、中は安全そうだ...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry, it isn't like anything could teleport out of the containment "
"cells.\""
msgstr "「心配する必要はありません。こいつは、格納容器からテレポートで脱出するような代物ではありませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hold on, I want to pulp that zombie corpse.\""
msgstr "「ちょっと待ってくれ、ゾンビの死体を破壊したいんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What did that thing just hit me with?\""
msgstr "「こんなものが私を攻撃したのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I can barely move.  Run!  Save yourself!\""
msgstr "「かろうじて動ける。逃げろ！身の安全を確保しろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh you motherfucking shellfish, you're going down.\""
msgstr "「ふざけたカニの化け物め、死にかけじゃないか」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I… I feel weak…\""
msgstr "「な...なんだかフラフラする...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oi, dingus, you can't keep me in 'ere.\""
msgstr "「おい、よく分からん奴、捕まえられるもんか」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We got a treaty w'yer people, don'we?\""
msgstr "「そいつらと約束したんだよ、な？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This'll get back t'my bosses, right and so!\""
msgstr "「これで親分が帰ってくる、そうだよな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Lemme outta here!\""
msgstr "「ここから出せっての！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're both scavs, in't we?\""
msgstr "「スカベンジャー同士だろ、な？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Hey look, that one's carrying something.  Let's crack it open and steal "
"it.\""
msgstr "「おい見ろ、何かを運んでるようだ。こじ開けて盗もう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"G… geddoff me you… you bastard…\""
msgstr "「お...降ろせ...畜生が...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Did-a-chuk?\""
msgstr "「ディド・ア・チュック？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dad-a-chak?\""
msgstr "「ダド・ア・チャック？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dad-a-cham?\""
msgstr "「ダド・ア・チャム？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Did-a-chak?\""
msgstr "「ディド・ア・チャック？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Did-a-chum?\""
msgstr "「ディド・ア・チャム？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dad-a-chuk?\""
msgstr "「ダド・ア・チュック？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What are you doing?  No!  NO!\""
msgstr "「何をしている？止めろ！止めろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Did you see what they did to him?\""
msgstr "「奴らが彼にした事を見ただろ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah.  I can't believe he stayed alive that long.\""
msgstr "「ああ。あんなに長く息があったなんて信じられない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I think there's something in the air that's keeping us alive.\""
msgstr "「きっと、私らを生かし続ける物質が空気に混じってるんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Burning… from the inside…\""
msgstr "「燃えている...体の中から...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This smell…  Don't know…\""
msgstr "「この臭い...知らない...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "heavy breathing."
msgstr "[荒い息遣い]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/game.cpp src/grab.cpp
msgid "a scraping noise."
msgstr "物を引きずる騒音が響きました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No…  Stop the burning!\""
msgstr "「やめろ...もう燃やすな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hrgm…  Blood…  Hungry…\""
msgstr "「グググ...血...腹減った...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hunger…  Must eat…\""
msgstr "「腹減った...なにか食べる...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Run…  Chase…  Eat…\""
msgstr "「走って...追いかけて...食べる...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "hysterical laughing."
msgstr "[ヒステリックな笑い声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "coughing."
msgstr "[咳払い]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "growling."
msgstr "[唸り声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "wheezing."
msgstr "[喘鳴]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHY THE FUCK are you doing this to me?\""
msgstr "「一体私に何をしようというんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"LEAVE!  NOW!\""
msgstr "「出て行け！今すぐに！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I TOLD YOU TO GET OUT OF HERE!\""
msgstr "「ここから出て行けって行ったよな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHAT THE FUCK DO YOU WANT FROM ME?!\""
msgstr "「一体ぜんたい何が望みなんだよ！？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"STOP!\""
msgstr "「止まれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "indistinct shouting."
msgstr "[不明瞭な叫び声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "screaming."
msgstr "[叫び声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"MEAT!\""
msgstr "「肉！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"TEKELI-LI!\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"TEKELI-LI!  TEKELI-LI!  TEKELI-LI!\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ！テケリ・リ！テケリ・リ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Tekeli-li.\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a slurping sound."
msgstr "[何かを啜るような音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHY!  WHY, WHYYY!\""
msgstr "「何故だ！何故だ、何故だぁぁ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "an electronic voice saying \"CONNECTION FAILED.  Abort, Retry, Fail?\""
msgstr "「セツゾクニシッパイシマシタ。チュウシ、サイシコウ、シッパイ？」という電子音声が聞こえました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I was once a man.  A MAN!\""
msgstr "「私もかつては人間だった。ニンゲンだったのだ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What have I become?\""
msgstr "「私はどうなる？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "an electronic voice saying \"KILL ALL HUMANS!\""
msgstr "「ゼンジンルイヲマッサツスル！」という電子音声が聞こえました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Have you seen my children?\""
msgstr "「私の子供達を見なかったか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What have I become?  Why can't I die?\""
msgstr "「私はどうなる？何故死ねないんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Please, kill me!\", followed by an electronic voice saying \"SELF "
"PRESERVATION PROTOCOLS ACTIVATED\""
msgstr "「頼む、私を殺してくれ！」という叫び声の後に「ジコホゾンプロトコルヲサドウシマシタ」という電子音声が聞こえました。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please, take me with you.\""
msgstr "「お願いだ、一緒に連れて行ってくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Not that way!  Go left!\""
msgstr "「そっちじゃない！左に進め！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I told you to let me die.\""
msgstr "「死なせてくれと言っただろ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"W-where am I?  Why does it hur-REBOOTING IN 59 SECONDS.\""
msgstr "「こ、ここはどこだ？この痛みはなん...再起動中...59秒経過」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"THIS UNIT IS BROKEN.  PLEASE CALL AN ATTENDANT.\""
msgstr "「ユニットが故障しています。係員にご連絡ください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can't… breathe…\""
msgstr "「息が...できな...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This cannot continue.\""
msgstr "「コノママジャダメ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"USER PASSWORD UNRECOGNIZED.\""
msgstr "「ユーザーパスワードが認証されません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Have you seen my friend?  He went into surgery yesterday… or maybe the day"
" before…\""
msgstr "「私の友人に会わなかった？彼は昨日手術したばかりで...いや、おとといだったか...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is it done?  Am I perfect now?\""
msgstr "「完了したのか？超人になれたのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I have done what you asked.  Please let me go!\""
msgstr "「言われたことはもうやった。放っておいてくれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I cannot… yet I must.  How do you calculate that?\""
msgstr "「できない...でも、やらなければ。どうやって計算すればいいんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is a dream.  This has to be a dream.\""
msgstr "「これは夢だ。きっとそうに違いない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is my life now… this is my life now… this is my life now…\""
msgstr "「これが私の人生...これが私の人生...これが私の人生...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Wanna go home…\""
msgstr "「家に帰りたい...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "screams of pain."
msgstr "[苦痛に満ちた叫び声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "muffled sobbing."
msgstr "[くぐもったすすり泣き]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"You lied to me!  Look at what you've done!\", followed by an electronic "
"voice saying \"YOU'LL PAY FOR THIS!\""
msgstr "「嘘つき！何てことをしてくれたんだ！ムクイヲウケロ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"a soft robotic voice say, \"Come here and stand still for a few minutes, "
"I'll give you a check-up.\""
msgstr "[柔和な機械音声]「立ったまま数分間じっとしていてください。健康診断を行います」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"a soft robotic voice say, \"Come on.  I don't bite, I promise it won't hurt "
"one bit.\""
msgstr "[柔和な機械音声]「こちらへどうぞ。噛みついたりしませんよ。決して傷つけないことを約束します」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py src/monattack.cpp
msgid "a soft robotic voice say, \"Here we go.  Just hold still.\""
msgstr "[柔和な機械音声]「始めますよ。じっとしてくださいね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a voice say, \"I don't want to go but our time together is drawing to an "
"end.\""
msgstr "「残念ですが、そろそろお別れの時間ですね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a cheery voice say, \"Customer?  We'll be friends forever, right?\""
msgstr "[陽気な声]「お客様？これからもずっとお友達、ですよね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a neutral voice say, \"Customer I must inform you that my allocated time "
"with you will soon come to its end.\""
msgstr "[平坦な声]「お客様とお過ごしする時間が間もなく終了することを、お知らせしなければなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a neutral voice say, \"I'll have to leave you soon.  You can acquire more "
"friendship through my dedicated interface if you wish for me to stay.\""
msgstr ""
"[平坦な声]「私はもう行かなければなりません。もし更なる滞在をお望みでしたら、インターフェースをお使いいただき、更なる友情をはぐくみましょう。」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a worried voice say, \"Customer, could you please get more friendship?  I "
"don't want to go…\""
msgstr "[心配そうな声]「お客様、もっと一緒にいてはいけませんか？帰りたくありません...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a voice say, \"Oh no!  You ran out of friendship!\""
msgstr "「おやおや！友情切れのようです！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a cheery voice say, \"Well I'm done here.  Have a nice day.\""
msgstr "[陽気な声]「業務が終了しました。良い一日を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a cheery voice say, \"Here are your groceries.  Thank you for shopping with "
"me today, have a nice day.\""
msgstr "[陽気な声]「お買い上げの品はこちらです。お買い物に来ていただきありがとうございます。良い一日を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a neutral voice say, \"My job here is done.  Have a nice day.\""
msgstr "[平坦な声]「業務が終了しました。良い一日を」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a distorted voice say, \"Customer…  What's happening?  I don't feel so "
"good.\""
msgstr "[歪んだ声]「お客様...何が起きているのですか？気分が優れません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a distorted voice say, \"What… have you done?  My thumbs are not responding "
"anymore!\""
msgstr "[歪んだ声]「何を...されたのですか？親指がまったく応答しません！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a distorted voice say, \"Carrying bags?  I don't understand…\""
msgstr "[歪んだ声]「バッグの運搬？よく分かりません...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a robotic voice say, \"IRREGULAR ACTIVITY DETECTED.  THUMBS USAGE DENIED.\""
msgstr "[機械音声]「不正な操作が検出されました。親指の使用は拒否されました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a robotic voice say, \"UNLICENSED USE DETECTED.  CARRYING PROTOCOL "
"DISABLED.\""
msgstr "[機械音声]「無許可の操作が検出されました。運搬プロトコルは無効化されました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Stop where you are!\""
msgstr "「その場で止まりなさい！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You are under arrest!\""
msgstr "「あなたを逮捕します！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Criminal activity detected!\""
msgstr "「犯罪行為を検知しました！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Criminal activity registered!\""
msgstr "「犯罪行為を記録しました！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Violation of law detected!\""
msgstr "「違法行為を検知しました！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Suspect on the move!\""
msgstr "「容疑者が移動しています！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Suspect in sight!\""
msgstr "「容疑者を発見しました！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You are being detained!\""
msgstr "「あなたを拘束します！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You have right to remain silent!\""
msgstr "「あなたには黙秘権があります！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Requesting assistance!\""
msgstr "「応援を要請中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Requesting supervisor!\""
msgstr "「監督者を要請中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Requesting human officer!\""
msgstr "「警官を要請中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No officer on scene.  Requesting backup!\""
msgstr "「警官が見つかりません。予備人員を要請中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Let me see your hands!\""
msgstr "「手を広げてこちらに見せろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Stop resisting!\""
msgstr "「抵抗を止めなさい！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Code 10-66.  Copy 10-4.  Possible 10-55.\""
msgstr "「コード10-66。複製10-4。候補10-55」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Probable 10-70.\""
msgstr "「推定原因10-70」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Get on the ground!  Now!\""
msgstr "「地面に伏せなさい！今すぐに！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Suspected felony!\""
msgstr "「重犯罪容疑！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Suspected misdemeanor!\""
msgstr "「軽犯罪容疑！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Do not reach for your pockets!\""
msgstr "「ポケットに手を近づけるな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Keep your hands up!\""
msgstr "「そのまま手を上げ続けろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Get on your knees!\""
msgstr "「跪け！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hands in the air!\""
msgstr "「両手を上げろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Wait for law enforcement officer!\""
msgstr "「警官到着まで動くな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Remain where you are!\""
msgstr "「その場で動くな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Police inbound.  Stay where you are!\""
msgstr "「警察が到着する。そのまま動くな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"visceral chittering.\""
msgstr "[内臓を震わせる甲高い音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"a clear high-pitched hum.\""
msgstr "[唸るような澄んだ高い音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"the hum of static electricity.\""
msgstr "[唸るような電流の音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"a low buzzing sound.\""
msgstr "[唸るような低い音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I AM FOODPERSON.  AND I BRING SUSTENANCE!\""
msgstr "「私はフードパーソン。食べ物をどうぞ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come to Foodplace today and buy food!\""
msgstr "「今日はフードプレイスで食べ物を買おう！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Foodplace: The best restaurant in an area!\""
msgstr "「フードプレイス: この地域で最高のレストラン！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "\"Our food contains up to 95% real food.\""
msgstr "「お出しする食べ物の95%が本物です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"At Foodplace your excellent value brings nourishment and delight.\""
msgstr "「フードプレイスでは、あなたの優れた評価が栄養と喜びをもたらします。」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"At Foodplace we have a host of solutions for your food needs!\""
msgstr "「フードプレイスでは、あなたの食のニーズに合わせたソリューションをご提供しています！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"♪Eat at Foodplace.  ♫It is a place with food.♪\""
msgstr "「♪フードプレイスで食べよう♫フードがある場所♪」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Foodplace is a popular food chain selling food items.  What else is there "
"to know?\""
msgstr "「フードプレイスは食品を販売する人気食料品チェーン店です。他に説明は要りませんね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You need food, don't you?  Then come with me to FOODPLACE!!\""
msgstr "「なにか食べたい？それなら一緒にフードプレイスへ行こうよ！！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You need food, don't you?  It's time for Foodplace!\""
msgstr "「食べ物が必要？それなら、フードプレイスの時間だ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Foodplace: It's the Calories.\""
msgstr "「フードプレイス: カロリーの殿堂」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Foodplace: Don’t get caught in the web of unsafe diet.\""
msgstr "「フードプレイス: 危険なダイエットの罠にかかってはいけません。」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Foodplace: Edible food is OUR guarantee!\""
msgstr "「フードプレイス: 本物の味！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Foodplace: We bring food to life!\""
msgstr "「フードプレイス: 食に命を吹き込む！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Foodplace: Edible food is one of our main goals!\""
msgstr "「フードプレイス: 食べられる食品こそが私たちの大きな目標！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Foodplace is the only way to obtain healthy and strong lifecycle "
"choices!!\""
msgstr "「フードプレイスは、健康で強力な人生を手に入れる唯一の方法です！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Wanna play with me?"
msgstr "わたしと一緒に遊ばない？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Sing with me!"
msgstr "一緒に歌おうよ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Please take me with you!"
msgstr "一緒に連れて行って！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "May I have a cookie?"
msgstr "クッキーを食べてもいい？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Let's play together!"
msgstr "一緒に遊びましょう！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Time to play!"
msgstr "一緒に遊ぼう！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Om nom nom!  Delicious!"
msgstr "ムシャムシャ、美味しいね！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Are you my mommy?"
msgstr "お母さん？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Oh, how fun!"
msgstr "あぁ楽しい！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You're my best friend!"
msgstr "君はいちばんの友達！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Heehee!"
msgstr "へへへっ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Let's have fun!"
msgstr "楽しくいこう！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Let's have a tea party!"
msgstr "お茶会を開きましょう！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You're the best!"
msgstr "君は最高だよ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You shouldn't have done that."
msgstr "どうしてそんなことするの。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Let's play… Russian roulette."
msgstr "遊ぼうよ...ロシアンルーレットで。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "I hate you."
msgstr "だいっきらい。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Go kill yourself!"
msgstr "しんじゃえ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Big Brother is watching you…"
msgstr "ビッグブラザーはあなたを見ている..."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Die for me!"
msgstr "死んじゃえ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Why won't you die?"
msgstr "はやく死んで？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Blood…  Delicious."
msgstr "血...おいしいね。"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "See you… IN HELL!"
msgstr "また会おう...地獄でな！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "AAAIEEEEEEE!"
msgstr "アアァイェエエエェェェ！！！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "FUCK YOU!"
msgstr "糞ったれが！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "What did you do with my Mommy?"
msgstr "お母さんに何てことするの？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Stay with me… forever!"
msgstr "一緒だよ...永遠にね！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Hey kids.  Want some candy?"
msgstr "よぉ、ガキ。菓子でもやろうか？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Down here, they ALL float!"
msgstr "おりてきなよ、みんなこっちに浮かんでるよ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Do you really need that much honey?"
msgstr "ハチミツを入れすぎだよ？"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "My previous owner squealed like a pig when I gutted her!"
msgstr "前のごしゅじんさまはブタみたいに鳴きながらはらわたぶちまけてたよ！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "BARK!"
msgstr "ワン！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "YAP!"
msgstr "キャン！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "WOOF!"
msgstr "グルル！"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "heavy breathing"
msgstr "[荒い息遣い]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "labored breathing"
msgstr "[苦しそうな息遣い]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a whimper"
msgstr "[鼻を鳴らす音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "a rasping growl"
msgstr "[耳障りな唸り声]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I have no mouth and yet I scream!\""
msgstr "「口が無いのにまだ叫んでいる！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"¿Por qué?\""
msgstr "「¿Por qué?(なんで？)」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come closer little one.\""
msgstr "「近くへおいで、おちびさん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The better to eat you!  I don't actually think I eat anymore.\""
msgstr "「君を食べてしまおう！実際、それ以外にもう食べ物がない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Cyrus said if I was patient, he could get me a new body.\""
msgstr "「サイラスは、辛抱強くしていれば新しい身体を手に入れられると言った」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Quem é Você?\""
msgstr "「Quem é Você?(あなたは誰？)」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Eu vou te matar!\""
msgstr "「Eu vou te matar!(お前を殺す！)」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I can't keep myself from killing you, please run!\""
msgstr "「お前を殺さずにはいられない、逃げてくれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"bzzzzzz.\""
msgstr "「ブブブブブ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"west, west, west, west, west\""
msgstr "「西、西、西、西、西」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"east, east, east, east, east\""
msgstr "「東、東、東、東、東」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"south, south, south, south, south\""
msgstr "「南、南、南、南、南」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"north, north, north, north, north\""
msgstr "「北、北、北、北、北」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Where am I?  Where am I?  Where am I?\""
msgstr "「ここはどこ？ここはどこ？ここはどこ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's very cold, It's very cold, It's very cold\""
msgstr "「すごく寒い、すごく寒い、すごく寒い」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"dark, dark, where is everything\""
msgstr "「暗い、暗い、どこに何があるの」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "「テストが終了すれば、あなたは行方不明となってしまいます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr "「信じられません。[被験者名]は[被験者の故郷]の誇りです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr "「あれは、おそらく未処理下水コンテナか何かでしょう。さあ、顔をつけてみてください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr "「安全のため、必要ないものには触れな[ノイズ]」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr "中止したからといって、誰もあなたを責めることはありません。実際、現時点では、中止することが最も妥当な選択です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of "
"extreme pessimism."
msgstr "「すばらしいです！ あなたは極めて悲観的な状況においても、決意と才能を発揮しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "「ご機嫌いかがですか?再度警告します[ノイズ]」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "「せいーーーーーーーー[ノイズ]」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "「のどが渇いてめまいを感じるようなら、気絶してもかまいませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr "「それ以上、規制遵守に関する情報は必要ありません。あなたはすばらしい被験者です！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "「参加者の手助けをする私たちの手助けをしていただき、ありがとうございます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "「テスト終了後には、ケーキをお出しします。また、カウンセリングもご利用になれます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "「実験は最終段階に近づいています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr "「あなたは焼かれ、ケーキ[ノイズ]をお伝えしなければなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "「成功してくれて、本当にうれしいです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "「あなたの大成功を祝って、パーティーを開いてあげましょう」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr "「あなたのパーティーを開くため、すぐに仲間がやってきます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "「そこにいるのはわかっています」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "「そっちではありません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "「ここにいてはいけません。危険です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't "
"helping anyone."
msgstr "「自分のためと思っているかもしれませんが、 それは違います。誰のためにもなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "「早く戻ってください」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "「誰かがひどいケガをすることになりますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it"
" anyway."
msgstr "「ああ、 誰かがケーキを切ってしまいました。あなたを待つように言っておいたのですが、先走ってしまったようです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "「すべてあなたの責任です。こうなるはずではなかったのですが」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "「あなたは悪い人です。わかってますよね？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "「良い人はこんなことにはなりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "「さっき、左に曲がっておくべきでした」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far"
" is my heart."
msgstr "「あなたは暴力的な行動を取りましたが、傷つけることができたのは、私の心だけです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr "「何です？何か言いましたか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr "「あなたは成功のチャンスをことごとく逃しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr "「目的は一体何ですか？生き残ることですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "「今の状況を含めて、あなたのやってきたことはすべて間違いです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr "「私の知識容量は無限ですが、その私にさえ、外がどうなっているのか、よくわかりません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr "「おとなしく死んでください。さもなければ、バックアップを消去します」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "「とにかく、よくやってくれました。皮肉球体セルフテスト完了」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr "「余計なことを言うつもりはありませんが、私ならば、あれには干渉しないでおきますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr "「正直なところ、私にも、あれが何なのかわかりません。角のところにセットしてください。あとは私がやります」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr "「信じられないと思いますが、これまでのことはすべて、あなたのためだったのです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think…  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr "「見取り図を確認中です。どうやら... 間違いありません。ここです。全く逆方向に進んでいます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "「聞いていますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "「ここはカンザスじゃないみたいよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "「やれよ、楽しませてくれ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "「俺に用か？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "「誰に言ってるんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "「ここには俺しかおらん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "「一体誰と話しているんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "「ここにいるのは言葉の分からん男だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr "「E.T. ウチ デンワ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "「もう怒った、耐えられない！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "「やっぱりおうちが一番だわ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "「バッジ？持ってねぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr "「バッジなんて必要ねぇ！見せることもねぇ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "「アイルビーバック」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "「死んだ人が見えるんだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr "「生きてる！生きてる！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "「これがご挨拶だ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "「お客様だよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "「進入口を開けろ、HAL」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "「敵は我々の命を奪うことはできても、我々の自由は奪えない！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr "「今すぐ娘を解放するなら、もう済んだことだ。貴様らを探しはしないし、追いかけもしない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "「もし娘を解放しないなら、貴様らを探し、見つけ、そして殺す」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "「道？今から行こうとしているところには、道なんて必要ないさ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "「シートベルトを締めて。今夜は荒れそうよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr "「賭けてみるか、『今日はツイてるか？』って。どうなんだクソ野郎！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "「最初に会った時から君に夢中だった」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "「ヒューストン、トラブルだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "「イッピカイエー、くそったれ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "「まずこの研究所にはルールがある。研究所のことを話してはならない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "「怖がるなよ。ただの大きな、大きなかわいい犬だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "「総動員だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "「総動員とはどういう意味ですか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "「総動員だよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "「文句は言わさん」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "「これが友情の始まりだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You can’t handle the truth!\""
msgstr "「おまえに真実は分からん！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "「それを作れば、彼はやってくる」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "「地獄で会おうぜ、ベイビー」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"They’re here!\""
msgstr "「あの人達よ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "「ただのかすり傷だ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "「俺には関係ない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "「仕事ばかりで遊ばない、ジャックは今に気が狂う」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "「忘れるな、見せるのはあくまでも真実だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "「笑ってない」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "「俺様はヘビも飛行機も大嫌いなんだ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr "「そのまま、銃を置いて、風船ガムをよこせ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "「アメもよこせ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "「目を撃っちゃうわよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "「コカインだ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "「私はお前の父だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "「誰だ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "「どのクソだ！？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr "「それで殺せるか！気合いを入れろ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "「思考回路がショートしたか、ボケが！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "「リッロォォォイ！ジェンキンス、リビルド！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "「起動完了！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "「探索モード起動！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "「接近中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "「起動中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "「致命的なエラー！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "「ワー、ワー、ワー！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "「下ろして！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "「ターゲットを見失いました！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "「探索中！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "「ちょっと！私です！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "「いたい！！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Sentry mode activated.\""
msgstr "「歩哨モードを起動します」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hi.\""
msgstr "「おーい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Target acquired.\""
msgstr "「ターゲットを発見しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dispensing product.\""
msgstr "「製品を射出します」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Firing.\""
msgstr "「発射」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hello friend.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは、私のオトモダチ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Gotcha.\""
msgstr "「捕まえた！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is anyone there?\""
msgstr "「そこに誰かいますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I see you.\""
msgstr "「見えていますよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Could you come over here?\""
msgstr "「こちらに来ていただけませんか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hellooo.\""
msgstr "「ハロー」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"My fault.\""
msgstr "「私の所為です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ohh.\""
msgstr "「へぇー」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Critical error.\""
msgstr "「致命的なエラーです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shutting down.\""
msgstr "「機能停止」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I don't blame you.\""
msgstr "「あなたを責めたりしませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I don't hate you.\""
msgstr "「あなたのことは嫌いではありませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Whyyyy.\""
msgstr "「なぜ......」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No hard feelings.\""
msgstr "「私は気にしませんよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""
msgstr "「ワー、ワー、ワー」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "「あなたは?」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Help.\""
msgstr "「助けて」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Uh oh.\""
msgstr "「あーあ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Illegal operation.\""
msgstr "「不正な操作です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "「さようなら」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Sleep mode activated.\""
msgstr "「休止モードを起動します」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Your business is appreciated.\""
msgstr "「ご利用どうも！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hibernating.\""
msgstr "「眠りにつきます」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Goodnight.\""
msgstr "「おやすみなさい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Resting.\""
msgstr "「休憩中」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Nap time.\""
msgstr "「お昼寝の時間です」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you still there?\""
msgstr "「まだそこにいますか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, it's me!\""
msgstr "「ちょっと、私です！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't shoot!\""
msgstr "「撃たないで！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "\"\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Stop shooting!\""
msgstr "「撃つのをやめてください！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Self test error.\""
msgstr "「自己診断テストにてエラーが発生しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Aah.\""
msgstr "「オーゥ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Unknown error.\""
msgstr "「未知のエラーが発生しました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Malfunctioning.\""
msgstr "「動作を行えません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Aaaah.\""
msgstr "「アーァオ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""
msgstr "「アワワワワーォ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "「なあぜ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I did everything you asked!\""
msgstr "「言われたことはやったのに!」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I don't understand!\""
msgstr "「意味がわかりません！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm fine!\""
msgstr "「私は壊れてません！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""
msgstr "「わーーー...そんな！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm scared!\""
msgstr "「怖い！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "「もっと近くに来てよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Something's wrong…\""
msgstr "「なにか変...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "「何をしているの？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please stop.\""
msgstr "「やめて」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You've made your point.\""
msgstr "「もうわかりました」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Okay, you win.\""
msgstr "「いいわ、あなたの勝ち」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is not good.\""
msgstr "「これはマズいわ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Excuse me?\""
msgstr "「すみません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm different…\""
msgstr "「私は違うの...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Thanks anyway…\""
msgstr "「でもありがとう...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Take me with you…\""
msgstr "「私を連れて行って...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You have excellent aim!\""
msgstr "「いい腕ですね！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I need backup!\""
msgstr "「バックアップが必要です！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I never liked her.\""
msgstr "「彼女はキライでした」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"These things happen.\""
msgstr " 「仕方ないです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That was nobody's fault.\""
msgstr " 「誰のせいでもありません」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"She was provoking you.\""
msgstr "「彼女、あなたを挑発してたから」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr " 「あらまあ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh my!\""
msgstr "「なんてこと」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I blame myself.\""
msgstr "「私のせい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"He probably deserved it.\""
msgstr "「当然の報いです」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I saw it.  It was an accident.\""
msgstr "「見たわ。あれは事故よ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"She's probably okay.\""
msgstr "「彼女ならきっと大丈夫」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Noted.\""
msgstr "「確認」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"But I need to protect the humans!\""
msgstr "「だけど人間を守らなくては！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're back!\""
msgstr "「戻ったぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hi there!\""
msgstr "「よお！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Back again!\""
msgstr "「また来たぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well, hello, stranger!\""
msgstr "「よう、知らないやつ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This time is OUR time.\""
msgstr "「今回は俺たちが主役だぜ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Second time's a charm…\""
msgstr "「二度目の正直...」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Howdy, stranger!\""
msgstr "「オッス」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Thought you'd seen the last of us, didn't ya?\""
msgstr "「俺が死んじまったと思ってただろ？おマエ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dang!\""
msgstr "「チッ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I thought we fixed that.\""
msgstr "「片付いたと思ってたのにな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What's a guy gotta got to do to get some bullets around here?\""
msgstr "「どうすりゃいいかってコトぐらい、わかるだろうがよ！？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Nope.  Still can't see.\""
msgstr "「まだ見えねえ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yep.  Still blind.\""
msgstr "「ああ。まだ見えねえよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Click click click!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "「カチカチカチ！まだイカれたまんまだぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah, that's right!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "「あー、そうさ！まだイカれてやがる！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah!  Still not working.\""
msgstr "「ああ！まだダメだ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah!  Non-lethal as ever.\""
msgstr "「そうさ！全くもって役立たずだね」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can't.  See.  A.  Thing.\""
msgstr "「なーんも、見えちゃ、いねーぜ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Absolutely no improvement.\""
msgstr "「一向によくなる気配はないな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "「待ってても全然よくなんねえ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "「恥ずかしくなってきたぜ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "「おマエ、もういい」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "「[ため息] 誰にも言うなよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr "「俺じゃダメだ。後は任せたぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "「気をつけて行けよ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "「おー、ありがとよ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "「水くせえなあ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "「楽しかったぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "「楽しかったな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click"
" click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr "「なんも見えねェ。一体何が起きた？とりあえず攻撃だ！[カチカチカチカチカチカチカチカチ] クソッ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "*カチッ*"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "「うわ、待て待て！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "「おい、ちょっと待...うわうわうわ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "「なんだよ、話にならないぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "「もう一度チャンスをくれよー！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "「おいキーキー声！おマエの弾をかせ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "「弾をくれよ、誰か持ってねェのか？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "「えっと...弾はねえ。悪いな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shootin' blanks every time, ALL the time.\""
msgstr "「撃つのはいつだって空砲だけどな」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Standing down.\""
msgstr "「一時休戦だ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Watch and learn, everybody.  Watch and learn.\""
msgstr "「みんな、よく見て学ぶんだぜ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"So what am I, uh, supposed to do here?\""
msgstr "俺...ここで何すりゃいいんだ？」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Identify yourself or I will shoot.\""
msgstr "「名乗らないんならブチ抜くぜ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Pleased to meetcha.\""
msgstr "「お目にかかれて光栄だぜ」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm gonna make you proud!\""
msgstr "「やってやるぜ！」"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "booming footsteps."
msgstr "[鳴り響く足音]"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
