#. ~ Description for shallow chocolate
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chocolate isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be tasty."
msgstr "それほど水深が深くない液状のチョコレートです。水密性のある容器を使えば、カカオ液を汲み入れられます。飲んでも美味しくありません。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "deep chocolate"
msgstr "深いチョコ溜まり"

#. ~ Description for deep chocolate
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chocolate here is deep enough to drown in.  With a watertight container,"
" you could gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be "
"tasty."
msgstr "溺れるほど水深が深い液状のチョコレートです。水密性のある容器を使えば、カカオ液を汲み入れられます。飲んでも美味しくありません。"

#. ~ Description for caramel
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An extremely hot, glowing liquid, composed of molten caramel.  In some "
"places, caramel coated fruit is a delicacy."
msgstr "溶融したキャラメルで構成された、光を発する非常に熱い液体です。フルーツのキャラメルがけという珍味が名物の地域があるそうですよ。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "singing sand"
msgstr "鳴き砂"

#. ~ Description for singing sand
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A formation of sand containing special minerals to produce whistling noises "
"when stepped on and from the wind."
msgstr "強風が吹いたり踏んだりしたときに笛のような音を出す、特殊なミネラル分を含んだ砂地です。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "outcrop"
msgstr "露頭"

#. ~ Description for outcrop
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the "
"surrounding terrain.  Could be as a surface for a number of things or "
"climbed on if worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "周囲の地面から飛び出した大きく鋭い岩場です。表面には様々なものが付いており、適切な靴を着用していれば登攀も可能です。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "dune"
msgstr "砂丘"

#. ~ Description for dune
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge sand dune that is continually reshaped by the wind.  Climbing it will"
" be troublesome."
msgstr "風によって絶えず形が変化する、巨大な砂丘です。面倒ですが登攀は可能です。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "desert pavement"
msgstr "砂漠舗装"

#. ~ Description for desert pavement
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Not that kind of pavement!  Naturally occurring pockets of densely packed "
"rock fragments that is easier to traverse than sand, with the right "
"footwear."
msgstr "舗装道路ではありません！岩石の破片がぎっしりと詰まっており、適切な靴を着用していれば砂地よりも楽に歩けます。"

#. ~ Description for scorched earth
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cracked and dry soil that doesn't look like it will be capable of supporting"
" anything in your lifetime."
msgstr "乾燥してひび割れた土壌です。一生待っていたとしても、何かが生えてくるとは到底思えません。"

#. ~ Description for cactus
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A tall cactus."
msgstr "背の高いサボテンです。"

