#: src/character.cpp
msgid ""
"You have far more fat than is healthy or useful.  It is causing you major "
"problems."
msgstr "とても健康的とは言えない量の脂肪が付いています。健康に大きな問題を引き起こします。"

#: src/character.cpp
msgid ""
"You have too much fat.  It impacts your day-to-day health and wellness."
msgstr "太りすぎです。日々の健康に影響を及ぼします。"

#: src/character.cpp
msgid ""
"You've definitely put on a lot of extra weight.  Although helpful in times "
"of famine, this is too much and is impacting your health."
msgstr "余分な脂肪が身体にたくさん付いています。飢饉の際には役立つでしょうが、日常生活での健康に影響を及ぼします。"

