"a soft robotic voice say, \"Unhand this patient immediately!  If you keep "
"interfering with the procedure I'll be forced to call law enforcement.\""
msgstr "[柔和な機械音声]「今すぐ患者さまから離れなさい！業務妨害を続けるようなら、自動的に法執行機関へ連絡されます」"

